				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="rounded-5 p-6 mt-9" style="background-color:white;">
		<div class="column">
			<h2 class="fs-4">Ways You Can Help</h2>
<p></p>
<p><span>It’s easier than you think to support veterans who are struggling in your community. We rely on <a href="https://donate.centralusa.salvationarmy.org/campaign/815566/donate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">financial contributions</a>, <a href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/usa-central-territory/volunteer/">volunteer service</a>, and <a href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/corporate-partnerships" target="_blank" rel="noopener">partnerships</a> to help provide basic necessities, opportunities, stability, and hope to those who have served our country.</span></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
